## Third-party content

This repository license covers original repository documentation, CLI source,
and original skills authored here. It does **not** override third-party
licenses, attribution requirements, or ownership for:

- catalog-only recommendations (upstream links only)
- maintained forks and any vendored third-party skill content
- dependencies of the CLI or of individual skills

Each skill and catalog entry must retain its own license and attribution
declarations. When a license is unknown, record it as `unknown` rather than
implying the repository MIT license applies.
